          {"op": "set", "path": "abilities.ability1.effects[type=projectile].life", "value": 2.5}]}},
      "ai": {"range": [2.2, 7.0]}},
    "spring_pad": {"name": "Spring Pad", "category": "utility", "use": "ability2",
      "short": "Plants a launch pad ahead: Jitters bounces, foes land stunned",
      "desc": "Jitters plants a spring pad two metres ahead for ten seconds (two at most). Anyone who steps on it is thrown into the air: an opponent lands stunned, while Jitters' own bounce makes its next Squash free and doubles its Pinball. The pads sit in plain sight: walk around them.",
